# Panes - nvim (actions/nvim/nvim_panes.kbd)
**panes + ent**        -- Pane Maximize ([esc] :PaneMaxToggle [ret])
**panes + h**          -- Pane Left (A-h)
**panes + l**          -- Pane Right (A-l)
**panes + up**         -- Pane Above (A-k)
**panes + j**          -- Pane Below (A-j)
**panes + -**          -- Pane Horizontal Split ([esc] :sp [ret])
**panes + \**          -- Pane Vertical Split ([esc] :vs [ret])
**panes + w**          -- Close Pane (C-w c)
**panes + toggle**     -- Pane Toggle (C-w p)
**panes + resize + h** -- Pane Resize Left (C-w <)
**panes + resize + l** -- Pane Resize Right (C-w >)
**panes + resize + k** -- Pane Resize Above (C-w -)
**panes + resize + j** -- Pane Resize Below (C-w +)
